      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Finding a streetwear factory takes a few weeks. Finding one that still performs on your third order takes longer, because discovery was never the hard part. Verification is. This guide follows the sequence that works: define the product, pick an entry channel, vet the supplier against pass/fail criteria, run a paid sample round, then scale out of a test order without blowing up the relationship</p>
